{
    "title": "DMV Written Exam Practice App",
    "description": "Get ready for your DMV Written Exam with our practice app. With up-to-date questions and answers, our app is the perfect tool to help you prepare and pass your DMV exam on the first try.\r\n\r\nPass your DMV permit test the first time with DMV Written Exam PracticeTest app. We give you state-specific DMV trial tests that are the same as the real thing. Practice your driving permit test through the most diversified learners permit test app.\r\n\r\nTo pass the learners , you will need to read the most recent edition and we have just updated our Driving and CDL Prep app for all 50 states.\r\n\r\nPRACTICE DMV TESTS MAKE YOU PASS FASTER\r\nA whopping 5 out of 10 people fail the DMV test the first time they take it, but the people that use DMV Written Exam PracticeTest see a 99% pass rate. We also let you take every sample permit test and Drivers license test for free as many times as needed so you can be sure you're ready for the real thing.\r\n\r\nWHY CHOOSE DMV WRITTEN TEST?\r\n\u2022 State-Specific Tests: Because each state has different driving laws and restrictions, we've tailored our tests to each specific state. This isn't one of those generic Driving practice tests.\r\n\r\nWHY WE\u2019RE SO EFFECTIVE\r\n\u2022 Know what to expect: Our tests have the same number of questions and the same passing score requirements as the actual tests so you'll know what to expect.\r\n\u2022 Stay motivated to study: With our practice tests you'll learn as you go and see your own progress in real time.\r\n\r\n\u00a7 DMV TEST FEATURES \u00a7\r\n \r\n\u2022 App includes state specific practice tests that includes car, motorcycle and CDL vehicle tests.\r\n\u2022 User can select his state and vehicle for practice tests.\r\n\u2022 App provide explanation of every DMV practice question.\r\n\u2022 After completion of every test you can see your test result status(Pass / Fail).\r\n\u2022 App also provide different traffic signal or road signs with categories.\r\n  - Colors - Guide - Recreation - Regulation - School - Shapes  - Toll Road - Warning\r\n\u2022 You can add your favorite questions in favorite list for future use.\r\n\u2022 App also provide common road signs that used in our day to day life.\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD the all new DMV Written Exam PracticeTest app for FREE!!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready for your DMV Written Exam with our practice app. With up-to-date questions and answers, our app is the perfect tool to help you prepare and pass your DMV exam on the first try.<br><br>Pass your DMV permit test the first time with DMV Written Exam PracticeTest app. We give you state-specific DMV trial tests that are the same as the real thing. Practice your driving permit test through the most diversified learners permit test app.<br><br>To pass the learners , you will need to read the most recent edition and we have just updated our Driving and CDL Prep app for all 50 states.<br><br>PRACTICE DMV TESTS MAKE YOU PASS FASTER<br>A whopping 5 out of 10 people fail the DMV test the first time they take it, but the people that use DMV Written Exam PracticeTest see a 99% pass rate. We also let you take every sample permit test and Drivers license test for free as many times as needed so you can be sure you&#39;re ready for the real thing.<br><br>WHY CHOOSE DMV WRITTEN TEST?<br>\u2022 State-Specific Tests: Because each state has different driving laws and restrictions, we&#39;ve tailored our tests to each specific state. This isn&#39;t one of those generic Driving practice tests.<br><br>WHY WE\u2019RE SO EFFECTIVE<br>\u2022 Know what to expect: Our tests have the same number of questions and the same passing score requirements as the actual tests so you&#39;ll know what to expect.<br>\u2022 Stay motivated to study: With our practice tests you&#39;ll learn as you go and see your own progress in real time.<br><br>\u00a7 DMV TEST FEATURES \u00a7<br> <br>\u2022 App includes state specific practice tests that includes car, motorcycle and CDL vehicle tests.<br>\u2022 User can select his state and vehicle for practice tests.<br>\u2022 App provide explanation of every DMV practice question.<br>\u2022 After completion of every test you can see your test result status(Pass / Fail).<br>\u2022 App also provide different traffic signal or road signs with